r country is also engaging in  This Global race for the latest  Technologies for the latest industrial  outputs in in clean energy and we've got  a choice we're either going to lead that  Global race and get these those jobs and  those Technologies in this country or or  we cannot and and we believe that with  the right investment with the right  Partnerships and with things like GB  energy coming on stream we can really  sees those opportunities and that's a  very different economic model it's a  very different Vision to the kind of  country and society that the  conservatives are now pursuing which is  will stand back it's you know we will  not get involved in trying to seize  these opportunities or just give a tax  break to a few at the top we'll let  Bankers bonuses go up through the roof  and we'll hope and pray that that will  reach places like Liverpool Manchester  Burnley or Blackpool well they didn't  over the last 30 years and and they  won't again and I think people are now  seeing a big choice in this country  about the kind of government they want  to see okay it's good to see you sorry  I'm not there in person again hopefully  I'll see you soon thanks a lot  see you soon okay bye thanks a lot

